    "name": "Gentle Psycho :: Yan Side",
    "steam_appid": 3785640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/3ddccfc77fb1cd6c4562a967f43f9f94.avif?t=1750070629\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make a contract with me, and become the hero!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working as a government official as well as a hero in Hero Corporation, you receive a special mission one day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must scout a new hero</strong> for Hero Corporation, as they're always short of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They suggested two possible candidates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One is the highborn <strong>CEO of Pricher Corporation</strong>, a multinational company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the other is <strong>the president of Rockheid Konzern</strong>, one of the weapon manufacturers partnered with Hero Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to make a hero out of the man who has everything he ever wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can it be done?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/29c2052fc3d6a939ab020ab02fdd5690.avif?t=1750070629\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/664e3c9bfa8200c1edac32834a2804c9.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yan</strong> / VA. Lee Kyung tae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI don't know if you've noticed, but I like you quite a bit.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CEO of the multinational company, Pricher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can just glance at him and recognize the old money dignity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has natural elegance and laid back demeanor, always smiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's hard to guess what he is actually thinking,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but he has a terrifying secret that no one knows about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/32a2eac984eb10faa9bc3fb302c7d6d9.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cShut up. I do what I like.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jin</strong> /<strong> </strong>VA.\u00a0Jung Eui jin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CEO and CTO of Rockheid Konzern, one of the weapon manufacturers partnered with Hero Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An imposing man with a predator's aura.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He seems very unapproachable with his cold attitude and curt language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He only engages in things that profits him in practical ways,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and never believes in other human beings enough to be close with someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/147d9d1b3623a21518cc854182469709.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span><strong>Ain</strong> / VA. Jung Eui taek</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHey, there.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man with mysterious vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His eyes are always empty, like he's in his own world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He behaves like a child sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character with impulsive and unpredictable side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/403a5a07bd09b5b31987126acfc5c25b.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rize</strong> / VA. Lee Eun jo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAs you may know... The work's not the problem, it's you, boss.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chief Secretary of Pricher Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woman with a meticulous manner, always wearing a suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's polite but blunt, and very capable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can also be unimaginably bold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/7f25de42ad7f9876d89bbefacc000dc3.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span><strong>Mew</strong> / VA. Kim Ha ru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf anyone gives you a hard time, you gotta tell me.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colleague from Hero Corporation and childhood friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A popular hero with athletic skills and amazing senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's well known with the people as she works mostly in field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's hard to see her anymore as you work in different departments,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but you're still close enough to eat together at home after work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/dc8ba5f5fa388e7f79f8a47a6f3c0008.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span><strong>Teo</strong> / VA. Park Seong yeong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cD-Do you remember me? You saved me once before\u2026\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idol that recently gained popularity 3 years after his debut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His model-like slim figure with sexy eyes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the honest and cheerful personality got him a lot of fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His agent is trying to hide the fact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that he's been infatuated with heroes for a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/17cb2462b2e86f051e69f817f554eacb.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inn</strong> / VA. Park Yo han</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThis world is in need of virtuous, powerful individuals.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chief Director of Hero Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1st gen hero who's been active even before the organization existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has now retired from the field and managing the Hero Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's one of the founding members that adapted to the new material, Ort, along with your missing father Nox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's also a well-respected boss for all heroes for his reasonable and decisive leadership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/d915ddb3922dee1324ffcd80ba8a0ec1.avif?t=1750070629\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exciting Storyline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more slow-paced, stretched storyline that seems to never end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle Psycho's storyline is composed of <strong>multiple episodes with moderate length </strong>instead of each episode being too slow-paced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can always check their progress and stop at any point during the episode, <strong>controlling their progression speed at their own pace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Irresistible Dialog Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player doesn't stop at being a third-person spectator, but become<strong> the center of the story </strong>and interact with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle Psycho's dialog choices <strong>offer emotional communication</strong> with characters instead of being too superficial or formal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more intimate and deep exchanges, there are about 400 dialog choices for Yan's route alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captivating Illustrations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>more than 20 illustrations</strong>, including the ending CG, to bring an impact to the most important moments in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Texts and Calls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1:1 chat with the characters and talk more intimately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features texts and calls like there is a real person talking behind the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the user's relationship with the characters change as they progress, the texts and calls become more intimate to match the level of relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become closer with characters other than the romanceable ones as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Talk After Ending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special talk for those who're still in the Gentle Psycho universe after the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the special Free Talk by <strong>Yan's voice actor, Lee Kyung-tae</strong>, after the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He talks about Yan's first and last impression, how he felt while being in the character, and a<strong> special behind-the-scene story in the recording booth</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts with the voice actor who went through the story with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/3ddccfc77fb1cd6c4562a967f43f9f94.avif?t=1750070629\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make a contract with me, and become the hero!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working as a government official as well as a hero in Hero Corporation, you receive a special mission one day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must scout a new hero</strong> for Hero Corporation, as they're always short of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They suggested two possible candidates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One is the highborn <strong>CEO of Pricher Corporation</strong>, a multinational company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the other is <strong>the president of Rockheid Konzern</strong>, one of the weapon manufacturers partnered with Hero Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to make a hero out of the man who has everything he ever wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can it be done?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/29c2052fc3d6a939ab020ab02fdd5690.avif?t=1750070629\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785640/extras/664e3c9bfa8200c1edac32834a2804c9.avif?t=1750070629\" width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yan</strong> / VA. Lee Kyung tae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI don't kn